' Repeated music playback: ten cycles of v1.2's map music in List mode (`preset
' classic ai none seed 3 start 30 music remaster map_music 2`). Each cycle:
' into Paradise Camp (a map scene: the playlist plays on), into its tent
' (the room's song; the playlist's place remembered), out again (the
' playlist resumed where it was), back to the world map, and 600 frames of
' the playlist. The AROS batch samples Avail from outside while it runs.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
wait 60
mapclick 110,122         ' cycle 1: into Paradise Camp
wait 60
mapclick 177,150         ' the tent: its song
wait 300
esc                      ' out: the playlist resumed
wait 120
esc                      ' the world map
wait 600
